Remoteproc README
~~~~~~~~~~~~

Supported boards:
	imx8mmevk
	imx8mnevk
	imx8mpevk
	imx8mqevk
	imx952evk
	imx95evk-19
	imx95verdin
	imx95evk-15
	imx95frdm-15
	imx93evk
	imx93evkpf09
	imx93qsb
	imx943evk-m70
	imx943evk-m71
	imx943evk-m33s

Usage:

param1: boards
param2: TCM or DDR demo. Some platform only has TCM demos.
param3: if uboot starts tty demo, use 'tty',
        if uboot starts 'pingpong', use pingpong
	if uboot does not start any demo, just use tty or pingpong.

rproc.sh [imx95evk-19] [TCM,DDR] [tty,pingpong]
